        "s7_text": "You have the right to access, rectify, erase, restrict or object to the processing of your data, as well as to data portability. To exercise these rights, email hola@nuvelshape.store identifying yourself as a customer and specifying the right you wish to exercise. We will respond within a maximum of 30 days.",
